             <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">FedCONSTClient<math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(m,w^{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(m,w^{k})</annotation></semantics></math></span>:

</div>
