             Assign global model to the local model <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{m}^{k}\leftarrow w^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{m}^{k}\leftarrow w^{k}</annotation></semantics></math>

